title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/KarlLiebknechtHaus.webp
max-visits: 8
#subtitle: text

= Party Organizations

Our party has many different programs and organizations, all with their own areas and competencies. Which do we wish to fund?

- @newspapers: Fund traditional media, like newspapers and physical ad campaigns.
- @social_media: Fund our social media apparatus.
- @tradeunions: Build up our connections to the trade unions.
- @fund_solid: Invest in our youth wing and grassroots organizations.
- @rosalux: Reduce party dissent with our thinktank, the Rosa Luxemburg Foundation.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@newspapers
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; newspapers += 1; urban_linke += 1*(1 - dissent); east_linke += 1*(1 - dissent);


@social_media
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; social_media += 1; youth_linke += 1.5*(1 - dissent); beweli_strength += 3; emali_strength += 2;


@tradeunions
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; tradeunion_contact += 1; urban_linke += 2*(1 - dissent); oldleft_strength += 2; beweli_dissent += 3 if bsw_split = 0; econ_moderation -= 0.5; upper_linke -= 0.2*(1 + dissent);

@fund_solid
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; solid += 1; beweli_strength += 2; pragmatist_strength -= 3; youth_linke += 1*(1 - dissent); social_moderation -= 0.5;

@rosalux
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; beweli_dissent -= 6; oldleft_dissent -= 6; emali_dissent -= 6; pragmatist_dissent -= 6;

@nothing
on-arrival: urban_linke -= 0.2*(1 + dissent); east_linke -= 0.2*(1 + dissent); rural_linke -= 0.1*(1 + dissent); upper_linke -= 0.1*(1 + dissent); youth_linke -= 0.3*(1 + dissent);

- @return: Continue...
